  "dg.chain.aria": "Certificate chain: the browser's built-in trust list, root certificate, intermediate certificate and site certificate, each level checking the one below it",
  "dg.chain.cap": "How a certificate chain passes trust from the built-in list down to the site, one level at a time. Each certificate is “name, public key, plus a signature from the level above”. Schematic; the names are the ones used in the model below.",
